From 05373aeb1f0b79a230568b63b80b7d6f017d1d82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Mar 2026 16:52:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/98] fix(agents): recognize claude-cli em-dash context
 overflow format in isContextOverflowError
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

claude-cli outputs "⚠️ Context overflow — prompt too large for this model." using
an em-dash (—), but isContextOverflowError only matched "context overflow:" (colon).
This caused Layer 2 retry (minimal bootstrap profile) to never trigger for cli-runner
overflow errors, and model-fallback to skip fallbacks without recovery.

Add em-dash and ascii double-dash variants to the match list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
